🚨 PUBLIC TRAFFIC ADVISORY 🚨

To ensure the #smooth_flow_of_traffic, prevent danger, and minimize inconvenience to the #GeneralPublic during the Hon'ble Chief Minister of Telangana State visit to a public meeting at #ThirmalapurVillage on 06.06.2025, #TrafficDiversions will be imposed on the movement of vehicles within the limits of the #Bhongir_Zone, Rachakonda Commissionerate.
📢 Public Cooperation Requested:
🔹 Please plan your travel accordingly.
🔹 In case of emergency or assistance, contact the Traffic Helpline.
We request the general public’s cooperation to ensure a safe and smooth event. 

